# pkg - Application-Level Shared Packages

This directory contains shared packages specific to this application.

## Guidelines

- **Application scope**: Code here is shared within this app only
- **No business logic**: Keep domain logic in `internal/domain/`
- **Reusable utilities**: Helper functions, type conversions, etc.

## Structure

```
pkg/
└── util/
    ├── string.go   # String utilities
    └── ptr.go      # Pointer helpers
```

## Usage Example

```go
import "{{.ModuleName}}/pkg/util"

// Create pointer from literal
req := UpdateRequest{
    Title: util.Ptr("New Title"),
}

// Safe dereference with default
name := util.DerefOr(user.Nickname, "Anonymous")
```
